<details id="browser-recovery-panel" class="browser-recovery-panel">
<summary id="browser-recovery-summary">Keep work on this browser, optional</summary>
<p id="browser-recovery-status" class="small" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">Saving is off. Keep a downloaded backup before leaving.</p>
<p class="small" id="browser-recovery-help">One recovery copy can stay on this browser after closing or refreshing. It includes your article, source notes, and saved review questions, in unencrypted site storage. Anyone using this browser profile may restore it. It does not sync to another device or save pending imports, unsaved editing tools, collections, or revision history. Only one tab can save at a time. Saving must be enabled again after reopening.</p>
<label class="check"><input id="browser-recovery-consent" type="checkbox" aria-describedby="browser-recovery-help"><span>I allow an unencrypted copy of this workspace, including private notes, to be kept on this browser.</span></label>
<div class="actions"><button id="browser-recovery-start" type="button" class="secondary" disabled>Enable browser recovery</button><button id="browser-recovery-inspect" type="button" class="secondary" disabled hidden>Review saved browser copy</button><button id="browser-recovery-now" type="button" class="secondary" hidden>Save recovery now</button><button id="browser-recovery-pause" type="button" class="secondary" hidden>Pause saving, keep copy</button><button id="browser-recovery-forget" type="button" class="secondary" hidden>Remove browser copy</button></div>
<section id="browser-recovery-preview" hidden aria-labelledby="browser-recovery-preview-heading"><h2 id="browser-recovery-preview-heading" tabindex="-1">Compare before restoring</h2><p id="browser-recovery-comparison" class="small"></p><label for="browser-recovery-fields">Compare a workspace field</label><select id="browser-recovery-fields"></select><div class="checkpoint-columns"><div><label for="browser-recovery-current">Current workspace text</label><textarea id="browser-recovery-current" rows="7" readonly spellcheck="false"></textarea></div><div><label for="browser-recovery-saved">Saved browser text</label><textarea id="browser-recovery-saved" rows="7" readonly spellcheck="false"></textarea></div></div><p class="small">Restore replaces every workspace field, including empty ones, and clears export approval and destination preferences. Previous valid writing is checkpointed in this tab. Finish or clear pending imports first. Unsaved editing preparation is discarded. Review notes use JSON list boundaries. Nothing is restored by this preview.</p><label class="check"><input id="browser-recovery-reviewed" type="checkbox"><span>I compared this saved copy with my current writing and reviewed the fields that will change.</span></label><button id="browser-recovery-restore" type="button" class="button" disabled>Restore reviewed copy and resume saving</button></section>
<p id="browser-recovery-date" class="small"></p><p class="small">Browser storage can be unavailable or cleared. For important writing, also use <a href="#workspace-files">a downloaded private backup</a>. Nothing is uploaded or published.</p>
</details>

